sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Vendor as Qualified Vendor
    participant Client as Frontend (MetaMask)
    participant IPFS as Pinata IPFS Cluster
    participant SmartContract as OilTenderingV1 (Proxy)
    participant Keeper as Autonomous Keeper
    participant Indexer as Event Indexer & SQLite

    Note over Vendor,SmartContract: Phase 1: Sealed Bid Commitment (Pre-Deadline)
    Vendor->>Client: Input Bid Amount (e.g., 0.45 ETH) & Technical Specs
    Client->>Client: Generate random 32-byte salt (crypto.getRandomValues)
    Client->>Client: Compute Commitment = keccak256(abi.encodePacked(vendorAddress, bidAmountWei, salt, tenderId))
    Client->>Client: Save salt & amount to LocalStorage and trigger JSON backup file download
    Client->>IPFS: Upload encrypted/technical specs doc -> returns CID
    Vendor->>Client: Confirm MetaMask transaction
    Client->>SmartContract: eth_sendTransaction: submitBid(tenderId, cid, commitment) {value: minEMD}
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Verify: caller registered vendor, now < submissionDeadline, value >= minEMD, no duplicate
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Store Bid in storage array; hasBid[tenderId][vendor] = true
    SmartContract-->>Client: Emit BidSubmitted(tenderId, bidId, vendorAddress)
    Indexer->>SmartContract: eth_getLogs catches BidSubmitted
    Indexer->>Indexer: Store indexed bid in SQLite (amount hidden, status='Submitted')

    Note over Keeper,SmartContract: Phase 2: Automated Bid Opening (Post-Deadline)
    Note over SmartContract: Submission Deadline Expires (block.timestamp >= openingTime)
    Keeper->>Keeper: Polling detects tender eligible for opening
    Keeper->>SmartContract: eth_sendTransaction: openBids(tenderId)
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Verify: now >= openingTime, status == Created
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Transition status = UnderEvaluation
    SmartContract-->>Keeper: Emit BidsOpened(tenderId, block.timestamp)
    Indexer->>SmartContract: eth_getLogs catches BidsOpened
    Indexer->>Indexer: Update tender status='UnderEvaluation' in SQLite

    Note over Vendor,SmartContract: Phase 3: Cryptographic Reveal (Reveal Window Active)
    Vendor->>Client: Open Tender Detail Page (Status: UnderEvaluation)
    Client->>Client: Retrieve salt & bidAmount from LocalStorage (or JSON file upload)
    Vendor->>Client: Click 'Reveal Bid'
    Client->>SmartContract: eth_sendTransaction: revealBid(tenderId, bidIndex, bidAmountWei, salt)
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Verify: now <= revealDeadline, status == UnderEvaluation
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Recompute keccak256(msg.sender, bidAmountWei, salt, tenderId)
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Assert recomputedCommitment == bid.bidCommitment
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Record bid.bidAmount = bidAmountWei; status = Opened
    SmartContract-->>Client: Emit BidRevealed(tenderId, bidIndex, vendorAddress, bidAmountWei)
    Indexer->>SmartContract: eth_getLogs catches BidRevealed
    Indexer->>Indexer: Update bid status='Opened', amount_eth, amount_wei in SQLite
